# Terraform working files and, crucially, anything that carries a real identifier
# or a secret. State can hold the sync secret under create_sync_secret=true;
# terraform.tfvars holds the real tenant id (CLAUDE.md: never commit one). The
# checked-in files are the .tf sources and terraform.tfvars.example only.
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
